          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ame abaka onwoŋo pwod tye akobo kop man, dwonnoro te katto i poto, ame kobo ni, “Abaka Nebukadnejar we, kop man otye akobbi ni locci doŋ okwanyo oko i ciŋi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 4:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "obino ryemi oko i akina dano, ibino cako nywako kabedo kede leyi me tim yin ibino camo lum calo twon, mannono bino timere i komi pi mwakki abiro, tuno ka doŋ ityeko ŋeyo ni Ŋat Amalo Meicel loo loc a dano, dok en twero miyo loc baŋ ŋat ame emito.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
